 "_comment": [
  "E5v2 - cases compared three ways: Firewall Insight 4.43 (static, read-only),",
  "fw up_execute on the active External cluster member (policy execution, no packet),",
  "and - where 'real' is set - a real connection from a lab client, judged from the",
  "gateway's own log record (show-logs) and the client's observation.",
  "O* = the 9 cases of E5 (4 Oct). N* = added for the reviewers (11 Oct).",
  "in_ifn: eth1 = from the inner gateway / lab side, eth2 = from outside.",
  "11 Oct: lab clients were reclaimed, so real traffic comes from the engineer laptop over VPN (laptop_cases); fw up_execute supports only ICMP echo request/reply, so the ICMP-code cases were dropped; IPv6 runs with fw6 up_execute."
 ],
